      "content": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Whitefield is one of the best localities in Bangalore and is becoming a popular destination for unmarried couples seeking affordable comfortable living. Perfect for modern infrastructure and good connectivity, this appeals to the needs of young professionals, students, and couples in search of a harmonious blend between the urban lifestyle and serene living. This place offers a wide variety of housing choices according to diversified budgets and people's tastes. Hence, a place is expected for any couple to suit their taste as if it's a home.</span></p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-91a07a4e-7fff-c138-85df-7d5591e64d18\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Being near IT hubs, shopping centers, cafes, and entertainment zones, Whitefield is the perfect choice for unmarried couples, as they can enjoy convenience and social interaction. Besides, the dynamic community of the locality and the safe neighborhoods welcome individuals to live together.</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Overview:</b></span></h2><p style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; verti